        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SPE2, Solid Brass Extended Lip Door Strikes</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis full lip door latch strike plate is available in 3 lengths and great finishes. It is made of solid brass. Packaged with matching finish #9 x 3/4\" wood screws for easy installation. It is especially handy for custom installations, and extra thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DEL-SPE200</b>\r\n<li>Lip Ext. Length: 1-1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DEL-SPE225</b>\r\n<li>Lip Ext. Length: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DEL-SPE250</b>\r\n<li>Lip Ext. Length: 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
