                "description": "Deltana SPE2  Extended Lip Door Strike Plates. Lip extensions of 1 1/2 inches, 1 3/4 inches and 2 inches. Available in Polished Brass, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Matte Black and Satin Nickel.",
